### Clean Architecture API Test File
### Sử dụng trong IntelliJ IDEA hoặc VS Code (với REST Client extension)

### 1. Create User - Success
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "fullName": "John Doe"
}

### 2. Create User - Invalid Email
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "fullName": "Jane Doe"
}

### 3. Create User - Short Name (Business Rule Violation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "short@example.com",
  "fullName": "A"
}

### 4. Create User - Duplicate Email (Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "fullName": "Another John"
}

### 5. Create Multiple Users
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "fullName": "Alice Smith"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "fullName": "Bob Johnson"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "charlie@example.com",
  "fullName": "Charlie Brown"
}
